"that uses *sys-firewall* as its net qube, *sys-firewall* will implement the "
"rules. This is done by the `qubes-firewall <https://dev.qubes-os.org/"
"projects/core-admin-client/en/latest/manpages/qvm-service.html#supported-"
"services>`_ service. You can verify that the service is running by executing "
