#: fdf46826187b419eb1ea2434762250d9
msgid ""
"The Whonix-Gateway (e.g. ``sys-whonix``) does not respect the qubes-firewall "
"service. Firewall rules configured via ``qvm-firewall`` or in the Qubes "
"Manager will have no effect. See the `Whonix documentation <https://www."
"whonix.org/wiki/Qubes>`__ for more details on networking in this "
"configuration."
msgstr ""

